---
import Layout from '@/layouts/Layout.astro';
import Button from '@/components/ui/button.astro';
import { ArrowLeft } from '@lucide/astro';
---

<Layout title="Ethos">
  <article class="prose prose-neutral mx-auto max-w-screen-sm py-12 dark:prose-invert">
    <h1>Our Ethos</h1>
    
    <p>
      We believe that memes are a universal language that transcends borders, cultures, and age groups.
      They have the power to make us laugh, think, and connect with others in ways that words alone cannot.
    </p>
    
    <h2>What We Stand For</h2>
    
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Community First:</strong> Everything we do is for the community.</li>
      <li><strong>Quality Over Quantity:</strong> We curate only the finest memes.</li>
      <li><strong>Accessibility:</strong> Memes should be free and accessible to all.</li>
      <li><strong>No Harm:</strong> We don't promote content that hurts others.</li>
    </ul>
    
    <h2>Our Promise</h2>
    
    <p>
      We will never sell your data, spam you with ads, or compromise on the quality of content.
      This is a labor of love, and we hope you enjoy browsing as much as we enjoy curating.
    </p>
    
    <div class="not-prose mt-8">
      <Button variant="secondary" href="/">
        <ArrowLeft class="mr-2 h-4 w-4" />
        Back to memes
      </Button>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
